          "key": "root",
          "label": "root",
          "type": "any"
        }
      ],
      "data": {
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Method demo\n\nThree small machines. In each, a **Property** changes and the **Methods** joined to it answer. Switch to **edit mode** (the pencil), then change a value on its card.\n\n1. **Members** 12 → set it to 3. *Quorum* goes false. Set it to 7: true.\n2. **Trigger** → change it. *Order* reads A → B → C: the Methods ran in the order of their edges. The Method that fails on purpose did not stop the ones after it, and Step D, on an edge that is switched off, never ran.\n3. **Probe** → change it. *Log* reads **Refused**: \"Overreach\" declared an update of Log only, so its attempt to change Quorum was refused. \"Nosy\" declares nothing at all and is refused anything.\n\nSelect a Method and press **Edit** to see its code, its triggers and its effects."
        },
        "interfaceContract": {
          "version": 1,
          "receivesViewContent": true
        },
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "method-demo",
          "nodeId": "method-demo-landing"
        }
      }
    },
